# What NOT to upload to Cloud Build.
#
# gcloud falls back to .gitignore when this file is absent, which would exclude
# seed-cache.db — the one artefact the image genuinely needs. This file exists
# to keep that single exception while still excluding everything sensitive.
#
# seed-cache.db is deliberately NOT listed: it is uploaded to Cloud Build and
# baked into the image, and never reaches the public repository.

.git/
.gitignore
venv/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# Credentials and captures — never leave this machine.
.env
*.har
*.pdf
docs/evidence/raw/
docs/evidence/request-log.jsonl
scripts/scrub_map.local.json
notes-comp

# Working files.
cache.db*
demo-cache.db*
profile_output*.json

# Not part of the deliverable.
AGENTS.md
PRD_Tross_LinkedIn_Profile_API.md
START_HERE.md
AGENT_KICKOFF_PROMPT.md
.claude/
